# Quebec with Church, Armory, Schoolhouse, Warehouse, Printing Press added (fixture).
# Start: 3 statesmen in the Town Hall (people strip 3,4,5), colonists 0,1,2 work tiles.
# People strip icons: x = 5 + 8*i, y = 155. Drop points sit above each building's worker strip.
click 168 128              # open Quebec
wait 10
drag 13 155 27 104         # strip colonist 1 (convert) -> Carpenter's Shop (1 of 3)
drag 21 155 27 104         # strip colonist 2 (fisherman) -> Carpenter's Shop (2 of 3)
drag 236 43 27 104         # drag from a work tile does not carry the worker: it only selects colonist 0
click 27 104               # click the Carpenter's Shop: selected colonist 0 joins (3 of 3)
drag 29 155 27 104         # strip colonist 3 (Town Hall statesman) -> full Carpenter: 4th refused
key Return                 # dismiss "no more than three colonists in one building"
drag 120 41 150 55         # Town Hall worker (Blacksmith expert) -> Schoolhouse: needs a college, refused
key Return
drag 30 117 150 55         # Carpenter worker (free colonist) -> Schoolhouse: not a skilled teacher, refused
key Return
drag 45 117 150 55         # Carpenter worker (fisherman expert) -> Schoolhouse: accepted (1 teacher)
drag 13 155 150 55         # strip colonist 1 -> Schoolhouse: faculty of one is full, refused
key Return
drag 113 41 20 16          # Town Hall worker -> Armory (Gunsmith), building to building
drag 37 155 155 18         # colonist 4 -> Fur Trader's House
drag 37 155 20 44          # colonist 4 -> Weaver's House
drag 37 155 80 56          # colonist 4 -> Rum Distiller's House
drag 37 155 108 56         # colonist 4 -> Tobacconist's House
drag 37 155 50 48          # colonist 4 -> Blacksmith's House
drag 37 155 27 104         # colonist 4 -> Carpenter's Shop (3 of 3 again)
drag 5 155 185 90          # colonist 0 -> Docks: no crew there, refused
drag 5 155 30 80           # colonist 0 -> Warehouse: refused
drag 5 155 185 22          # colonist 0 -> Printing Press: refused
drag 5 155 68 26           # colonist 0 -> unbuilt Custom House slot: nothing happens
drag 45 155 92 95          # colonist 5 (Blacksmith expert) -> Church (Preacher)
key Escape                 # back to the map
